{"type": "header", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid60", "load_s": 1.297, "peak_rss_mb": 504.2, "num_sentences": 30, "decode_params": {"model": "k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx tts-models/kokoro-int8-multi-lang-v1_1.tar.bz2", "model_file": "model.int8.onnx", "lexicons": ["lexicon-us-en.txt", "lexicon-zh.txt"], "rule_fsts": ["date-zh.fst", "phone-zh.fst", "number-zh.fst"], "sid": 60, "speaker": "zm_011", "speed": 1.0, "num_threads": 4}}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid60", "sentence_id": "s001", "text": "你好，今天的会议改到下午3点半开始。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.634, "n_samples": 87219, "proc_s": 5.1699, "rtf": 1.4226, "samples_sha256": "ff3e7ea3033c7d1e11f3b11d2444399774cf0b00f7e77e662ad923d14c6c570b"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid60", "sentence_id": "s002", "text": "我刚买了一部新的iPhone，用起来很顺手。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.164, "n_samples": 99942, "proc_s": 6.4237, "rtf": 1.5426, "samples_sha256": "103d06397f6b37239e1571c01fcece6bd2a8472e79bb575b1c1e817291f2c2dd"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid60", "sentence_id": "s003", "text": "这件衣服打折以后只要128元。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.251, "n_samples": 78033, "proc_s": 4.1219, "rtf": 1.2677, "samples_sha256": "b142d259dbd0bf78a7efce3602349ce581b39cdee81dcdf4547ed105caa9ca61"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid60", "sentence_id": "s004", "text": "我们约在2026年10月20日见面吧。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.466, "n_samples": 83191, "proc_s": 3.869, "rtf": 1.1162, "samples_sha256": "79ba6ae39ca42786be727035fb0c670a891e02bd696a0142a26520d4fb82f1eb"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid60", "sentence_id": "s005", "text": "请把报告在周五之前发给我。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.856, "n_samples": 68553, "proc_s": 3.4926, "rtf": 1.2227, "samples_sha256": "8155a911cbf4781f20a451c82067c0f5f7ffa81a8c25d1cbee55a3befd72d5ae"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid60", "sentence_id": "s006", "text": "现在的AI工具越来越好用了。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.32, "n_samples": 79674, "proc_s": 4.2661, "rtf": 1.2851, "samples_sha256": "11200ddd02ed68106aeaec88b380dd0a9d330a4b3feb318d1c292b3e3b1ba060"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid60", "sentence_id": "s007", "text": "你的航班几点起飞？我记得是早上8点20分。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.553, "n_samples": 109280, "proc_s": 5.799, "rtf": 1.2736, "samples_sha256": "09ee6bddcf263376586fa712fe2e5a28b13730e2a9f4b45dbff75d72dd3f40cf"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid60", "sentence_id": "s008", "text": "这个月的电费一共是356块钱。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.349, "n_samples": 80380, "proc_s": 4.1624, "rtf": 1.2428, "samples_sha256": "e548b552ce572918bff5ce0a0c83a92f5546f677db799db4a0b5eb7ef9adacc4"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid60", "sentence_id": "s009", "text": "我住在3楼，电梯就在门口右边。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.358, "n_samples": 80597, "proc_s": 4.4002, "rtf": 1.3103, "samples_sha256": "110be80cd17913137e6ca30aedad566ade189635a848adcd24fbd3f397d7df14"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid60", "sentence_id": "s010", "text": "他每天跑步5公里，已经坚持了两年。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.574, "n_samples": 85774, "proc_s": 4.7925, "rtf": 1.341, "samples_sha256": "9ee43ff8f525d50781d3b1c107f2f26dcf9a46a4b89d81a77a43658197264244"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid60", "sentence_id": "s011", "text": "下周一我们要去上海出差。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.611, "n_samples": 62664, "proc_s": 3.493, "rtf": 1.3378, "samples_sha256": "d7f2bcec8930466c83d0dd62480064c71026f8ce488827c1c0e0048f799d6975"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid60", "sentence_id": "s012", "text": "你能帮我订一张明天去北京的高铁票吗？", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.662, "n_samples": 87876, "proc_s": 4.5201, "rtf": 1.2345, "samples_sha256": "473617f7cfbe0bc06e3f8717f9e1010b1ef3e4a90319344349c83024340f44d6"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid60", "sentence_id": "s013", "text": "这家餐厅的评分是4.8分，值得一试。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.803, "n_samples": 91266, "proc_s": 5.3524, "rtf": 1.4075, "samples_sha256": "5e80457ebfc8ff9d5793dbcabfa13da68e5553c15a5cd549c27758ec862815c2"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid60", "sentence_id": "s014", "text": "我的手机号是13812345678，有事打给我。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.798, "n_samples": 115156, "proc_s": 6.0958, "rtf": 1.2704, "samples_sha256": "37902d0bfeae9bd21dddb8dc23df83e9c694e5ba2fabc2faab4083fc9af1d5eb"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid60", "sentence_id": "s015", "text": "今年公司的销售额增长了15%。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.999, "n_samples": 71972, "proc_s": 3.719, "rtf": 1.2401, "samples_sha256": "324e1d4ee04bf4ab67056e30e239253d0e54e2ae3388a634dbbf51fd867cb416"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid60", "sentence_id": "s016", "text": "孩子们放学以后在公园里踢足球。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.083, "n_samples": 73989, "proc_s": 3.7855, "rtf": 1.2279, "samples_sha256": "7d2647c9ccb9985a6795f23b770061c442adb9e7976c3ca28b1cb1e34b91495e"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid60", "sentence_id": "s017", "text": "我用微信给你转了2000块，记得查收。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.566, "n_samples": 85586, "proc_s": 5.021, "rtf": 1.408, "samples_sha256": "87a53a282ee821fea3bedb70c52cd4d3c9974a7febc5ede3d74f128dd995a3ee"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid60", "sentence_id": "s018", "text": "天气预报说明天最高气温32度。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.194, "n_samples": 76654, "proc_s": 4.0862, "rtf": 1.2794, "samples_sha256": "bdf218b9dfc6dc4b91cfc4ce302b3b54788b9317011b9b312715524c731766e3"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid60", "sentence_id": "s019", "text": "请问洗手间在哪里？", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.015, "n_samples": 48368, "proc_s": 2.619, "rtf": 1.2995, "samples_sha256": "213bf74eb506ec8a1a55e03b069a5e21d80bd5d6d1c22cec3f2fff523643be0c"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid60", "sentence_id": "s020", "text": "我们的Zoom会议链接已经发到群里了。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.525, "n_samples": 84595, "proc_s": 6.4, "rtf": 1.8157, "samples_sha256": "b996b968eeb5f536338a3d89e40db94a12f8b5780b8f7a2155089f78bf548bdc"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid60", "sentence_id": "s021", "text": "这本书我看了一半，故事特别精彩。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.481, "n_samples": 83550, "proc_s": 5.7466, "rtf": 1.6507, "samples_sha256": "93917ebe58bbe7e6578f4d78dfeda47b12f19288db326505c7427c50a980711e"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid60", "sentence_id": "s022", "text": "他的生日是5月4日，我们准备给他一个惊喜。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.499, "n_samples": 107983, "proc_s": 5.3994, "rtf": 1.2, "samples_sha256": "0921aac7535e0123dc80c7954b22ae0296a20f0bf7ee5ad65663d461dc1865a0"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid60", "sentence_id": "s023", "text": "从这里打车到机场大概需要40分钟。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.568, "n_samples": 85640, "proc_s": 4.1027, "rtf": 1.1497, "samples_sha256": "5a5ffffaf8eb2508bf99f9e8e0bc7e2bae055449b42a9e22d30eb4c6bb444fde"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid60", "sentence_id": "s024", "text": "我刚下载了ChatGPT的新版本。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.571, "n_samples": 85715, "proc_s": 4.9114, "rtf": 1.3752, "samples_sha256": "3a5d88b1dd0c09e7e030db844065eddf89618637f2686d3090c111fdca49f450"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid60", "sentence_id": "s025", "text": "房租每个月涨了500元，真让人头疼。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.755, "n_samples": 90112, "proc_s": 4.7372, "rtf": 1.2617, "samples_sha256": "35a58792a8edfc51c5cb55bb31e0860cb1fd02c39be103bbda9c5ddcedf38b16"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid60", "sentence_id": "s026", "text": "周末你想去看电影还是去爬山？", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.988, "n_samples": 71710, "proc_s": 3.725, "rtf": 1.2467, "samples_sha256": "b5fe78a9559cf22aac3f3219883ea81459bfd30f0f24663f9c4e05c6022e02b8"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid60", "sentence_id": "s027", "text": "这台笔记本电脑的价格是6999元。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.125, "n_samples": 98996, "proc_s": 4.8157, "rtf": 1.1675, "samples_sha256": "1014f1339ebc182f90a5616cea0eb7a612559dc742d13e40d82f6705d020486b"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid60", "sentence_id": "s028", "text": "医生建议我每天喝8杯水。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.551, "n_samples": 61213, "proc_s": 3.2257, "rtf": 1.2647, "samples_sha256": "400994556f1c3f5d1c79a87421b30f40d62a50e388e32c61af5daf34bd44c0fd"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid60", "sentence_id": "s029", "text": "我们团队一共有12个人，分成3个小组。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.028, "n_samples": 96678, "proc_s": 5.0044, "rtf": 1.2423, "samples_sha256": "1d06dd70c9d2c3e5806ebd1a82f0be113772d7b7088523fb76a2d12af589f830"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid60", "sentence_id": "s030", "text": "谢谢你的帮忙，下次我请你喝咖啡。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.459, "n_samples": 83007, "proc_s": 4.3042, "rtf": 1.2445, "samples_sha256": "189b43d89e3d640843cf094a0265013ec6c09f5d8261be9283d11974a3448a35"}
